OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 22 Oct to Sat 31 OctFA
OL,6,Fchangeable if not unsettled spell of
OL,7,Fweather will affect the UK through
OL,8,Fmost if not all this period, with
OL,9,Fspells of wet and windy weather
OL,10,Farriving from the Atlantic followed by
OL,11,Fdrier though still showery interludes.
OL,12,FIt is possible that stormy weather may
OL,13,Falso develop at times. However, there
OL,14,Fis a chance that higher pressure may
OL,15,Fbuild near the UK again around the end
OL,16,Fof October, bringing a quieter spell
OL,17,Fof weather for a time. Temperatures
OL,18,Fare likely to be near or a little
OL,19,Fabove normal overall, with mild spells
OL,20,Flikely at times, especially towards
OL,21,Fthe south. In between frontal systems,
OL,22,Fand if pressure does build at the end
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fof the period, colder nights are
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fpossible, with a touch of frost.
